// The arkan blade's Flames of Ralos burn (skill_combat/scripts/player/specs/scripts/arkan_blade.rs2).
//
// OSRS's burn, from the wiki's own Burn page: ONE hitpoint every FOUR ticks, ten hitpoints over
// forty. Up to FIVE burns can run at once; the frequency never changes, the damage per tick is the
// number of stacks, and a sixth burn is discarded rather than replacing an older one.
//
// This used to be 2 damage every 8 ticks with no cap. The total per burn was right, but it landed
// in lumps at half the rate, and nothing stopped a player stacking burns without limit - which is
// most of why the special read as overpowered in play.
^arkan_burn_hits = 10
^arkan_burn_damage = 1
^arkan_burn_interval = 4
^arkan_burn_max_stacks = 5
